   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Action nouns",
     "texto": [
      "The prefix and suffix **peng-…-an** can form nouns of action or process, such as **mencegah → pencegahan** (\"to prevent → prevention\") and **menggunakan → penggunaan** (\"to use → use\"). The exact form and sense depend on the word and the context.",
      "In English many translations end in **-tion**, but the correspondence is not automatic. Look at the verbal root and at the function the noun performs within the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
